Is that a pellet gun, Gummer?


00:06:03.572 --> 00:06:05.564
You bet
your sweet ass it is!


00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:07.777
Oh, since when
do you play with toys?


00:06:08.118 --> 00:06:11.111
