"How long's it been?"


00:08:34.639 --> 00:08:37.507
"Four or five weeks?" "Okay.
How'd the video shoot go?"


00:08:37.684 --> 00:08:39.391
Fascist jackals!


00:08:42.731 --> 00:08:45.098
Ooh, Government plates.
That can't be good.


00:08:45.525 --> 00:08:47.517
Let me guess. IRS?


00:08:47.694 --> 00:08:50.277
