subspecies


00:14:15.229 --> 00:14:17.846
known as the Ass Blaster
a.k.a. <i>Mexicana Combustus.</i>


00:14:18.024 --> 00:14:20.983
You're a treasure-trove of
Graboidology, Miss, but I...


00:14:21.069 --> 00:14:24.528
