tell you something.


00:16:18.394 --> 00:16:21.182
Burt Gummer's got
some big-ass shoes to fill.


00:16:21.772 --> 00:16:23.058
Size 12s.


00:16:23.232 --> 00:16:25.098
I've seen you
in the locker room.


00:16:25.234 --> 00:16:27.146
And you're my heir apparent.
Is that it?


00:16:27.236 --> 00:16:28.772
