00:16:40.458 --> 00:16:42.324
Hell, yeah, it was!
I was your wingman.


00:16:42.418 --> 00:16:44.205
Wingman?
More like wingnut!


00:16:44.378 --> 00:16:45.994
Come on, that's...


00:16:46.964 --> 00:16:48.500
