00:16:50.885 --> 00:16:51.875
Damn it!


00:16:54.889 --> 00:16:56.551
Are you willing
to follow orders?


00:16:57.600 --> 00:16:58.807
I mean,
sometimes, I don't...


00:16:58.893 --> 00:17:02.637
Look, the most important
six inches on the battlefield


00:17:02.730 --> 00:17:04.687
